# Vue 3 Enterprise Engineering Rules

## 1. Asset Reuse (Non-negotiable)
- Use `<pagination />` for table pagination (`total > 0`, `v-model:page`, `v-model:limit`, `@pagination="getList"`).
- Use `<right-toolbar />` for table actions and column toggles (`v-model:showSearch`, `@query-table="getList"`).
- Use `<dict-tag />` for dictionary status display (`:options="dict"`, `:value="scope.row.status"`).
- Use `useDict` from `@/utils/dict` to fetch dictionaries.
- Use `parseTime` from `@/utils/ruoyi` for timestamp formatting.
- See full dictionary: `docs/ai/ASSET_DICTIONARY.md`.

## 2. Component Splitting & Structure
- Single `.vue` file limit: **≤ 150 lines**.
- Split dialogs/drawers into `components/[resource]-dialog.vue`.
- Root element MUST be `<div class="app-container">`.
- Use `<script setup lang="ts">`.
- Always define route/component name using `defineOptions({ name: 'ModuleName' })`.

## 3. Styling & Tokens
- NO color literals like `#ffffff` or `rgba()`.
- Use Tailwind 4 utility classes with CSS variables:
  - Background: `bg-[var(--app-bg-page)]`, `bg-[var(--app-bg-plain)]`, `bg-[var(--app-bg-subtle)]`
  - Text: `text-[var(--app-text)]`, `text-[var(--app-text-secondary)]`, `text-[var(--app-accent)]`
  - Border: `border-[var(--app-border)]`
  - Radius: `rounded-[var(--app-radius-sm)]`, `rounded-[var(--app-radius-md)]`

## 4. API & Types
- Do NOT import `request` or `axios` in components.
- Import API functions from `@/api/...`.
- Define TypeScript interfaces in `src/types/api/...`.
- Always handle 4 states: Loading (`v-loading`), Empty, Error, Success.
- Add permissions to buttons with `v-hasPermi="['module:resource:action']"`.
